{"text":"And we have to practice empathy. And one of the groups that we are pretty bad at practicing empathy with is our young millennials. So let me show you what empathy looks like. Listening to understand, trying to understand someone's point of view and disposition. At 100% of the talks that I give or the meetings that I have, invariably, someone will raise their hand and ask about the millennial problem. Apparently, this young generation is unleadable. Apparently, they have confounded every single company in every single industry. And so now it's at the point where companies have given up and are now just asking millennials, what do you want? And so they say, we want free food and bean bags. And so now every company has free food and bean bags, and guess what? Nothing has changed.","words":[{"text":"And","start":0.0,"end":0.92},{"text":"we","start":0.92,"end":1.02},{"text":"have","start":1.02,"end":1.2},{"text":"to","start":1.2,"end":1.38},{"text":"practice","start":1.38,"end":1.72},{"text":"empathy","start":1.72,"end":2.18,"punct":"."},{"text":"And","start":3.16,"end":3.2},{"text":"one","start":3.2,"end":3.36},{"text":"of","start":3.36,"end":3.46},{"text":"the","start":3.46,"end":3.54},{"text":"groups","start":3.54,"end":3.7},{"text":"that","start":3.7,"end":3.86},{"text":"we","start":3.86,"end":4.06},{"text":"are","start":4.06,"end":4.34},{"text":"pretty","start":4.34,"end":4.7},{"text":"bad","start":4.7,"end":5.02},{"text":"at","start":5.02,"end":5.22},{"text":"practicing","start":5.22,"end":5.54},{"text":"empathy","start":5.54,"end":5.86},{"text":"with","start":5.86,"end":6.24},{"text":"is","start":6.24,"end":6.72},{"text":"our","start":6.72,"end":6.86},{"text":"young","start":6.86,"end":7.28},{"text":"millennials","start":7.28,"end":7.8,"punct":"."},{"text":"So","start":8.5,"end":8.56},{"text":"let","start":8.56,"end":8.66},{"text":"me","start":8.66,"end":8.74},{"text":"show","start":8.74,"end":8.88},{"text":"you","start":8.88,"end":8.98},{"text":"what","s